    },
    {
      "displayText": "Weißt du, welches das allerallerbeste Pokémon\nder Welt ist?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065006900DF0074002000640075002C002000770065006C0063006800650073002000640061007300200061006C006C006500720061006C006C006500720062006500730074006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E000A006400650072002000570065006C00740020006900730074003F001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Kokuna!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004B006F006B0075006E00610021001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Also trainier ich, um die beste Kokuna-Expertin\nvon allen zu werden! Bitte kämpf gegen mich!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sag mir, wenn du bereit bist!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006100670020006D00690072002C002000770065006E006E0020006400750020006200650072006500690074002000620069007300740021001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ich zeig dir meine coolen Kokuna! Bist du bereit?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006300680020007A00650069006700200064006900720020006D00650069006E006500200063006F006F006C0065006E0020004B006F006B0075006E00610021002000420069007300740020006400750020006200650072006500690074003F001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Das bin ich!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400610073002000620069006E002000690063006800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Noch nicht!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F006300680020006E006900630068007400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Menno, dabei will ich dir doch nur kurz meine\nKokuna zeigen!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065006E006E006F002C002000640061006200650069002000770069006C006C0020006900630068002000640069007200200064006F006300680020006E007500720020006B00750072007A0020006D00650069006E0065000A004B006F006B0075006E00610020007A0065006900670065006E0021001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cool!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F006F006C0021001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hier sind sie, meine Kokuna!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006900650072002000730069006E00640020007300690065002C0020006D00650069006E00650020004B006F006B0075006E00610021001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Du bist <U+0010><U+0004>ᄀÿᔓ<U+0000>ein starker Trainereine starke Trainerin. Von dir können\nmeine Kokuna bestimmt viel lernen!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 110
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh nein! Ich hoffe, sie haben nicht zu viele\nErfahrungspunkte erhalten!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mein Kokuna... Es hat sich zu Bibor entwickelt.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00650069006E0020004B006F006B0075006E0061002E002E002E0020004500730020006800610074002000730069006300680020007A00750020004200690062006F007200200065006E0074007700690063006B0065006C0074002E001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wenn das so weitergeht, werde ich niemals\nKokuna-Expertin...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065006E006E002000640061007300200073006F00200077006500690074006500720067006500680074002C00200077006500720064006500200069006300680020006E00690065006D0061006C0073000A004B006F006B0075006E0061002D0045007800700065007200740069006E002E002E002E001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sondern eine Bibor-Expertin!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F006E006400650072006E002000650069006E00650020004200690062006F0072002D0045007800700065007200740069006E0021001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ach, egal! Käfer-Pokémon entwickeln sich nun\nmal schnell.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100630068002C0020006500670061006C00210020004B00E4006600650072002D0050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200065006E0074007700690063006B0065006C006E002000730069006300680020006E0075006E000A006D0061006C0020007300630068006E0065006C006C002E001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ich muss einfach die kurze Zeit genießen,\ndie ich mit Kokuna habe.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006300680020006D007500730073002000650069006E006600610063006800200064006900650020006B00750072007A00650020005A006500690074002000670065006E0069006500DF0065006E002C000A00640069006500200069006300680020006D006900740020004B006F006B0075006E006100200068006100620065002E001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Du musst sie ja nicht entwickeln!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400750020006D007500730073007400200073006900650020006A00610020006E006900630068007400200065006E0074007700690063006B0065006C006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wie jetzt? Du meinst, Pokémon entwickeln sich\nnormalerweise nicht von allein, sondern nur,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nwenn man sich dafür entscheidet?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nDann müssen meine Kokuna ja was ganz\nBesonderes sein!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 188
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wie schön! Ich liebe Kokuna nämlich ganz doll!\nAber Bibor sind auch nicht schlecht...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nOooh, wie soll ich mich da nur entscheiden?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 138
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pokémon entwickeln sich also nur, wenn man\nin der Team-Übersicht „Entwickeln“ auswählt...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
